On here you can find the 3D-model of the airplane, aswell as a prepared bambu slicer version of the parts for ASA Aero filament.
The print-settings are not good the way they are in the Bambu-file, so modifying them is advised.
The parts made out of basic filament are in the seperate Basic filament-parts file aswell as Controller-Esp Backpack.
The pcb file is for manufacturing.
